    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我们要开始拍摄了！\n你能让开一下吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114EEC89815F0059CB62CD64444E86FF01000A4F6080FD8BA95F004E004E0B5417FF1F00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯？你那个超级环……\n看来你是个有实力的宝可梦训练家。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EFFF1F4F6090A34E2A8D857EA773AF20262026000A770B67654F60662F4E2A67095B9E529B76845B9D53EF68A68BAD7EC35BB6300200100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "其实我……是个懂行的人\n才认识的电影导演。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51765B9E621120262026662F4E2A61C2884C76844EBA000A624D8BA48BC6768475355F715BFC6F14300200100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想用手机洛托姆对密阿雷的\n野生宝可梦进行纪实摄影。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F37528624B673A6D1B625859C65BF95BC6963F96F77684000A91CE751F5B9D53EF68A68FDB884C7EAA5B9E64445F71300200100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "然后我看上的第一只就是\n会用尖锐牙齿袭击猎物的凶暴宝可梦<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n……利牙鱼！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7136540E6211770B4E0A76847B2C4E0053EA5C31662F000A4F1A75285C16951072599F7F88AD51FB730E7269768451F666B45B9D53EF68A600100001BE00000A20262026522972599C7CFF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但要直接拍摄野生宝可梦，\n老实说……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46898176F463A562CD644491CE751F5B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A80015B9E8BF42026202600100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "很危险！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F8853719669FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也就是说，我希望有谁的\n宝可梦可以来帮忙拍摄。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F5C31662F8BF4FF0C62115E0C671B67098C017684000A5B9D53EF68A653EF4EE567655E2E5FD962CD6444300200100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我问你！如果你带着利牙鱼的话，\n可以来帮忙拍摄吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621195EE4F60FF015982679C4F605E267740522972599C7C76848BDDFF0C000A53EF4EE567655E2E5FD962CD64445417FF1F00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果你愿意帮忙拍摄的话，\n就把利牙鱼放到同行队伍中吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C4F60613F610F5E2E5FD962CD644476848BDDFF0C000A5C31628A522972599C7C653E5230540C884C961F4F0D4E2D5427FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还不开始拍摄吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD84E0D5F0059CB62CD64445417FF1F00100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好紧张啊……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D7D275F20554A2026202600100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哦哦！你愿意让你的\n利牙鱼来帮忙拍摄吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54E654E6FF014F60613F610F8BA94F607684000A522972599C7C67655E2E5FD962CD64445417FF1F00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "让我们来帮你！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BA962114EEC67655E2E4F60FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF77B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我会给你报酬的！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114F1A7ED94F6062A5916C7684FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "演员齐了！\n开始拍摄！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6F1454589F504E86FF01000A5F0059CB62CD6444FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "接着拍下一个画面！\n预备……Action！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "63A5774062CD4E0B4E004E2A753B9762FF01000A98845907202620260041006300740069006F006EFF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "出现了！是利牙鱼！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51FA73B04E86FF01662F522972599C7CFF0100100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "救命呀！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6551547D5440FF01FF0100100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呜……呜呜……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "545C20262026545C545C202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "CUT！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004300550054FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "利牙鱼你怎么了！？\n你得嘎的一声袭击过去啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "522972599C7C4F60600E4E484E86FF01FF1F000A4F605F97560E76844E0058F088AD51FB8FC753BB554AFF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呜牙牙……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "545C72597259202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那个……导演……\n我查了一下。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E2A202620265BFC6F1420262026000A621167E54E864E004E0B300200100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "利牙鱼在落单的时候\n好像会变得非常胆小。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "522972599C7C5728843D5355768465F65019000A597D50CF4F1A53D85F97975E5E3880C65C0F300200100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "什么？这样可没法拍出\n我想象中的画面啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EC04E48FF1F8FD9683753EF6CA16CD562CD51FA000A621160F38C614E2D7684753B9762554AFF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过，被人类吓得\n战战兢兢的利牙鱼啊……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC7FF0C88AB4EBA7C7B54135F97000A62186218516251627684522972599C7C554A2026202600100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这样也不错嘛！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD968374E5F4E0D9519561BFF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然跟我想象的不一样，\n但感觉能拍出不错的画面！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D71368DDF621160F38C6176844E0D4E006837FF0C000A4F46611F89C980FD62CD51FA4E0D95197684753B9762FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "害怕人类的利牙鱼……\n这也会是个不错的画面哦！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BB360154EBA7C7B7684522972599C7C20262026000A8FD94E5F4F1A662F4E2A4E0D95197684753B976254E6FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "总之拍摄能有进展，实在太好了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "603B4E4B62CD644480FD67098FDB5C55FF0C5B9E5728592A597D4E86300200100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "利牙鱼意外地很可爱嘛。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
